WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
Thank you, guys.

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm so happy to be back
in New York.

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:03.470 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you so much.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah. Mm!

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:08.441
This is actually my second time
on "The Tonight Show."

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:10.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
My first time
on "The Tonight Show,"

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.911 line:92%
I came out to my parents.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:12.545 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:16.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was kind of
their reaction, too.

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:16.916 line:92%
It was interesting, though.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:18.284 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, my parents reacted
two different ways.

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:21.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, my dad saw it,
and he was like, "Oh, my God.

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:22.422 line:92%
I can't believe my son is gay.

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:25.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
I could have a stroke.
I could have a heart attack."

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:28.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "You're
being such a queen right now."

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.563 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:33.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
"This is kind of my moment,"
you know.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:34.367 line:92%
My mom was different, though.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
My mom saw the set,
and she immediately texted me

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:39.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
and was like,
"I love my gay son."

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:40.106 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:41.207 size:75% position:38%
And then she started
saying stuff like,

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.977 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I don't know, maybe I'm gay."
[ Chuckles smugly ]

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:48.114 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:51.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I think everyone's
a little gay, I don't know."

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:53.787
And I have two younger brothers,
Javaughn and Javeigh.

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:55.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
We couldn't afford
other letters.

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:58.858 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:01.961 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Chuckling ]

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:05.465
And my younger brother Javaughn
actually came out to me as bi

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
not too long after the set,
and I was shocked,

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:11.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
because, like, another person
stealing my moment.

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:13.673 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:16.509
But also, like, I'm gay,
my younger brother is bi,

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
and my youngest brother
is straight.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:21.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
So my mom's womb was
basically a gay dance club

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:23.716 line:92%
that became a Foot Locker.

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.952 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:29.956 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Chuckling ]

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:30.790 line:92%
But it was really interesting.

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:33.293
Like, the whole thing
brought me closer to my family,

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:34.160 line:92%
a lot closer to my culture.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm Jamaican,
and, like, afterwards,

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:39.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
I learned that
Bob Marley was biracial,

00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:39.833 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
which was wild.

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:40.600 line:92%
That kind of blew my mind,

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
because, like,
he loved reggae so much

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:45.338 size:78% position:39%
that I thought he was
just white, you know?

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:47.207 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:49.476 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I don't know.

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:51.478 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:58.118 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.986 align:start size:94% position:6%
But other than that, like,
not much has changed.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.255
Like, I'm still living in L.A.,
still don't drive,

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:04.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I take a lot
of ride shares, right?

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:05.792 align:start size:94% position:6%
For the first time
the other day,

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:09.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had a driver that
had a 3.8 rating.

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:12.365 line:92%
Like, are you murdering people?

00:02:12.365 --> 00:02:13.633 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:16.369
I got out of the car, like,
zig-zagging to my apartment

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:18.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
just in case he turned around
and just...

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:19.906 line:92%
[ Imitates blow dart, chuckles ]

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:22.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just, like, blow-darts me,
you know.

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:26.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
Takes my phone,
gives himself five stars.

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:30.917 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Chuckling ]

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:32.685 size:78% position:39%
I've also been trying
to get in shape, too,

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:34.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
just because L.A.
isn't a city like New York,

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:35.555 line:92%
where, like, in New York,

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:37.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
you can get exercise
just from walking around

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:41.661
and sweating out half
your body weight on the subway.

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:44.731 align:start size:94% position:6%
But...
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:46.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
L.A. is a city where, like,
you're in a car,

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:48.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're in a building,
you're in a car,

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:50.236
you're in another building,
you're in another building,

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:51.204 line:92%
in another car, until one day,

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:54.707
someone saw a monster-truck tire
and was like, "Enough!"

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:55.408 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:58.244 size:84% position:42%
And that's how CrossFit
was invented, you know?

00:02:58.244 --> 00:02:59.979 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:02.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was like,
"That felt pretty good.

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:05.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think I'll make that
my personality."

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:09.222 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:15.261 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:16.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I was like,
"Okay, if I work out,

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:19.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
I gotta do something gentle,
gotta start off easy.

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:20.833 line:92%
I'm gonna do yoga," right?

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:23.203
'Cause I thought yoga was
just laying on the ground

00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:24.270 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
for 45 minutes.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, halfway through
the first class,

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:28.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm just, like, on the ground,
just shaking.

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:30.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the instructor
comes up to me like,

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:31.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You can give up
or you can try."

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:34.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Chuckles ]
I was like, "Oh, my God.

00:03:34.647 --> 00:03:35.748 line:92%
I feel so attacked by this dude

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:38.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
in a Spiritual Gangster
crop top...

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:43.523
trying to gentrify my muscles,"
you know.

00:03:43.523 --> 00:03:44.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
But then I was like,
"You know what,

00:03:44.591 --> 00:03:46.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
any exercise I do
is gonna be difficult.

00:03:46.659 --> 00:03:47.760 line:92%
It's exercise, that's the point.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:51.631
I'm just gonna go all the way.
I'm gonna take an MMA class.

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:53.433 line:92%
I'm gonna learn how to fight."

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:55.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
First class,
I knew it was a mistake,

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:56.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I walk in
and I see the instructor

00:03:56.869 --> 00:03:59.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
just, like, full-on sprinting
on the treadmill,

00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:01.174 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
no headphones in.

00:04:01.174 --> 00:04:05.845 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:05.845 --> 00:04:08.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, any hearing person
at the gym with no headphones

00:04:08.514 --> 00:04:12.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
is training
to avenge someone's death.

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:13.987 size:78% position:39% line:92%
It's the only reason.

00:04:13.987 --> 00:04:15.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did learn one cool thing,
though, in this class.

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:18.124
I learned that if you're
getting choked standing up,

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:20.159 align:start size:94% position:6%
right, choked like this,
what you gotta do

00:04:20.159 --> 00:04:23.329 align:start size:94% position:6%
is you gotta twist your body,
drop your elbow,

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:25.632 size:88% position:44%
and then you can get out
of the hold safe, right.

00:04:25.632 --> 00:04:26.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
But the instructor
was like,

00:04:26.499 --> 00:04:28.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You know, sometimes, you're
in the middle of a fight,

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:30.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
you don't have time
to do all that choreo.

00:04:30.003 --> 00:04:32.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
You gotta do whatever it takes
to get out of that hold."

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:34.307 line:92%
And I was like, "Okay, got you."

00:04:34.307 --> 00:04:36.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
My partner put his hand
around my throat,

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:37.944 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and I went, "Oh, Daddy!"

00:04:37.944 --> 00:04:40.513 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:40.513 --> 00:04:42.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he let go!
And he let go.

00:04:42.882 --> 00:04:46.753
Sometimes love wins is basically
what I'm trying to say.

00:04:46.753 --> 00:04:48.321 line:92%
All right, thank you, guys.

00:04:48.321 --> 00:04:51.557
You guys have been so much fun!
Thank you!

00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:54.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my goodness!
Look at that!

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:58.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
Good for you, man.
-Yeah.

00:04:58.097 --> 00:04:59.632 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:59.632 --> 00:05:02.368 size:81% position:41% line:92%
